sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GMUI as ContentManagerUI
  participant API as CompendiumRouter
  participant QUERY as ContentQueryApplicationService
  participant QPOL as QueryDeterminismPolicy
  participant IDX as SearchIndexRepository
  participant DEF as DefinitionRepository
  participant LREP as LinkedEntryRepository

  Note over GMUI,LREP: Precondition: catalog_revision=600, 320 spells indexed, stable tie-breaker on definition_id

  GMUI->>API: GET /api/spells?query=fire&level=3&state=published&sort=name.asc&page_size=50 req-5301
  API->>QUERY: search_definitions(req-5301)
  QUERY->>QPOL: normalize_query(req-5301)
  QPOL-->>QUERY: normalized filters + deterministic sort tuple (name,definition_id)
  QUERY->>IDX: search(filters, sort, cursor=None, revision=600)
  IDX-->>QUERY: rows[0..49], next_cursor=cur_600_50
  QUERY->>DEF: hydrate detail-lite fields for rows[0..49]
  DEF-->>QUERY: hydrated rows
  QUERY-->>API: result payload + applied_filters + next_cursor
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK (50 rows, cursor=cur_600_50, revision=600)

  GMUI->>API: GET /api/spells?query=fire&level=3&state=published&sort=name.asc&page_size=50&cursor=cur_600_50 req-5302
  API->>QUERY: search_definitions(req-5302)
  QUERY->>QPOL: validate_cursor(cur_600_50, revision=600)
  QPOL-->>QUERY: ok
  QUERY->>IDX: search(filters, sort, cursor=cur_600_50, revision=600)
  IDX-->>QUERY: rows[50..99], next_cursor=cur_600_100
  QUERY-->>API: deterministic page 2 payload
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK (50 rows, no overlap with page 1)

  GMUI->>API: GET /api/spells/spell.fireball?include_reverse_links=true req-5303
  API->>QUERY: get_definition_detail(req-5303)
  QUERY->>DEF: get_by_id(spell.fireball)
  DEF-->>QUERY: full spell payload
  QUERY->>LREP: list_reverse(spell.fireball)
  LREP-->>QUERY: [class.wizard, class.sorcerer, item.scroll_of_fireball]
  QUERY-->>API: detail projection + reverse references + revision=600
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK

  GMUI->>API: GET /api/spells?query=fire&level=3&state=published&sort=name.asc&page_size=50 req-5304
  API->>QUERY: search_definitions(req-5304)
  QUERY->>IDX: search(filters, sort, cursor=None, revision=600)
  IDX-->>QUERY: rows[0..49], next_cursor=cur_600_50
  QUERY-->>API: same deterministic ordering as req-5301
  API-->>GMUI: 200 OK (stable order verified)

  Note over GMUI,LREP: Postcondition: list pagination and detail projection are deterministic under same revision snapshot